OL,3,GNEWSA#1m cocaine recovery after raids
OL,4,Ain Perthshire and Fife
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrugs worth almost #1m have been
OL,7,Frecovered by police after officers
OL,8,Fstopped a car in Perthshire.
OL,10,FDetectives said 3kg (6.6lb) of cocaine
OL,11,Fwas found in the vehicle in Abernethy
OL,12,Fat about 15:00 on Wednesday.
OL,14,FA subsequent search of a property in
OL,15,FMorar Street in Methil, Fife uncovered
OL,16,Fa further 6kg (13.2lb) of the Class A
OL,17,Fdrug.
OL,19,FA man and woman, aged 36 and 34, have
OL,20,Fbeen arrested and charged in connection
OL,21,Fwith the recovery.
